# S47 2026-07-07 (founder-approved: mirror deprecation) — Cloudflare
# Pages redirects for the marketing site.
#
# The legacy /docs/* mirror pages below are superseded by verified
# equivalents on docs.driftstack.io (S29/S37 content batches, every
# claim re-verified against source before carry-over). The .astro
# pages are DELETED in the same change — CF Pages serves static
# assets BEFORE evaluating _redirects, so a surviving page file would
# shadow its rule.
#
# ⚠️ Matching is EXACT-PATH: a rule for /docs/foo does NOT match
# /docs/foo/ and vice-versa (verified empirically 2026-07-07 via
# `wrangler pages dev` 4.59.2 — the bare rule 301'd, the slash
# variant fell through, and the inverse held too). Every route
# therefore carries BOTH spellings.
#
# NOT redirected (content-gap flags, S47 audit): /docs/billing-crypto-overview
# (VAT-invoice-on-request policy absent from docs) and
# /docs/billing-crypto-troubleshooting (support-response SLA absent
# from docs) — those pages stay until the docs carry the content.
#
# Format reference:
#   https://developers.cloudflare.com/pages/configuration/redirects/

